WEBVTT

00:03:57.233 --> 00:04:00.194
and didn’t pay all the taxes and tariffs,

00:04:00.194 --> 00:04:01.362
if you know what I mean.

00:04:02.405 --> 00:04:03.447
In order to do that,

00:04:03.447 --> 00:04:07.201
they bribed the Kyrgyzstan
Customs Service,

00:04:07.201 --> 00:04:10.705
and a significant chunk of this bribe
went to this person:

00:04:10.705 --> 00:04:11.831
Raimbek Matraimov,

00:04:11.831 --> 00:04:13.749
the Deputy Head of Kyrgyzstan’s Customs.

00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:16.711
Our investigations revealed

00:04:16.711 --> 00:04:21.257
that even high-ranking officials
in Kyrgyzstan are involved in corruption,

00:04:21.257 --> 00:04:24.760
poisoning their whole institutions
with the worst possible practices.

00:04:26.095 --> 00:04:29.932
People in Kyrgyzstan were outraged
when they read this,

00:04:29.932 --> 00:04:33.644
and this led to an unprecedented
chain reaction.